{
  "name": "litecut",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "LiteCut 轻剪 — 一个模仿剪映核心工作流的桌面视频剪辑器（Electron + ffmpeg）",
  "main": "main.js",
  "scripts": {
    "start": "electron .",
    "selftest": "node selftest.js",
    "subtest": "node subtest.js",
    "asrtest": "node asrtest.js",
    "exptest": "node exptest.js",
    "smoke": "electron smoke.js",
    "dist": "electron-builder --win nsis"
  },
  "comments": {
    "packaging": "打包：npm run dist（需先 npm i -D electron-builder）。whisper 二进制与模型（约 535MB）刻意不进包，打包版里语音识别会显示『缺 whisper』并置灰，其它功能不受影响；把 tools/whisper 放到安装目录(或源码目录)即可启用。"
  },
  "build": {
    "appId": "com.zncznc.litecut",
    "productName": "LiteCut",
    "directories": {
      "output": "dist",
      "buildResources": "build"
    },
    "files": [
      "main.js",
      "ipc.js",
      "preload.js",
      "tools.js",
      "exporter.js",
      "asr.js",
      "subtitle.js",
      "renderer.js",
      "index.html",
      "styles.css",
      "package.json"
    ],
    "win": {
      "target": [
        {
          "target": "nsis",
          "arch": [
            "x64"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "icon": "build/icon.ico"
    },
    "nsis": {
      "oneClick": false,
      "perMachine": false,
      "allowToChangeInstallationDirectory": true,
      "createDesktopShortcut": true,
      "createStartMenuShortcut": true,
      "shortcutName": "LiteCut 轻剪",
      "installerIcon": "build/icon.ico",
      "uninstallerIcon": "build/icon.ico",
      "installerHeaderIcon": "build/icon.ico"
    }
  },
  "author": "",
  "license": "MIT",
  "devDependencies": {
    "electron": "^33.2.0",
    "electron-builder": "^26.15.3"
  }
}
